{"version":1,"content":"<p>高海寧（高Ling）、周嘉洛及朱敏瀚（朱仔）擔任主持的無綫旅遊節目《Grand住去首爾》今晚（14日）播出最後一集。</p><p>當中最大亮點，莫過於高Ling與陶藝型男Oppa約會。</p><p>Oppa五官標致，外形高大健碩，十足韓星味道，高Ling第一眼已被對方</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T12:25:18.674123+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T12:01:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T12:18:07.221761+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T12:18:07.221761+00:00","content_hash":"5be1740fc55a3ab5b460bf67a4336a397811a195553e08a50acb74745292e6d9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}